t LOW or input, never output HIGH.\nSet CS=1/SCK=0/MOSI=0/RESET=0, wait rails and clock; enable U6, then release DDS reset.\nStart SPI at 100 kHz / MSB first / 24-bit commands. Keep U6 disabled during ISP." (at 20 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 220380ea-bc2c-4d7b-bf7f-8928a27c2c48)))